 life with her secret hobbies, while restoring their broken relationship and coming to terms with their true feelings for each other.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.2}],"value":7.2,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":5699,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}